refentry.refsect1:
&reftitle.parameters;
hostname
The hostname of the SNMP agent (server).
security_name
&snmp.parameter.security-name;
security_level
&snmp.parameter.security-level;
auth_protocol
&snmp.parameter.auth-protocol;
auth_passphrase
&snmp.parameter.auth-passphrase;
privacy_protocol
&snmp.parameter.privacy-protocol;
privacy_passphrase
&snmp.parameter.privacy-passphrase;
object_id
If an empty string, object_id is taken as .1.3.6.1.2.1, the root of the SNMP objects tree, and all objects under that tree are returned as an array.
If object_id is specified, all the SNMP objects below that object_id are returned.
timeout
The number of microseconds until the first timeout.
retries
The number of times to retry if timeouts occur.

&reftitle.returnvalues;

 Returns an array of SNMP object values starting from the
 object_id as root or &false; on error.
